              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiaanyiny ichek anyun eng’ bikab bororiosiek tugul, ak ang’at ripsosiekab tisiik ak che bo Lawik, age tugul eng’ boisiennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.30",
